OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog may be slow to clear in
OL,6,Fplaces. Cloud and patchy rain or
OL,7,Fdrizzle in parts of northern areas
OL,8,Fwill gradually spread southwards.
OL,9,FElsewhere, it will be mainly dry with
OL,10,Fsunny spells, with a few showers in
OL,11,Fthe far north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain in the south will
OL,14,Fclear. Elsewhere sees clear spells, a
OL,15,Ffew coastal showers in the north and
OL,16,Feast. A colder night with widespread
OL,17,Frural frost in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
