OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMostly dry with sunny spells
OL,6,Fafter early mist and fog clears.
OL,7,FShowers affecting northern, eastern
OL,8,Fand southeastern areas, heaviest in
OL,9,Fthe far southeast. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage for early November.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
